X-WR-CALNAME:Brevard Public Schools 2026-2027
X-WR-CALDESC:Brevard Public Schools 2026–2027 calendar: school begins Aug
  10 (kindergarten Aug 13\, Pre-K Aug 17) and ends May 26. See breaks\, ear
 ly release & PDF.
X-TXSC-CALENDAR-SCOPE:Brevard Public Schools regular district student calen
 dar\, excluding Challenger 7 Elementary’s modified calendar. The distric
 t opening date is August 10\; kindergarten starts August 13 and prekinderg
 arten August 17. Reporting dates distinguish elementary and secondary stud
 ents. The printed 180 pupil days describes the regular district schedule\,
  not a separate count for every starting grade.
X-TXSC-EXCLUDED-CAMPUSES:Challenger 7 Elementary School
